/T (To overcome these challenges, the SwiftShip Tracker platform was architected as an AI-enabled parcel management prototype on the Salesforce platform. The primary strategic objective is to resolve tracking fragmentation by integrating parcel booking, status management, stakeholder recording, and conversational customer support into a unified Salesforce architecture.)
