/T (During preview testing on 10/4/2026 the agent was asked for the details of parcel P-006. It answered with an owner, an address, a land use and an assessed value, none of which exist in the SwiftShip data model. The Agent Preview Details panel flagged the output evaluation as ungrounded and explained that the Parcel Tracker subagent had no actions available, so the model answered from its own pre-trained knowledge. A standard action named Get Activity Details, which retrieves call, email, event and task records, had been added but does not read parcel data.)
