/P 220 0 R
/T (Testing also produced useful engineering findings. Merge-field grounding reproduces stored values exactly, but an agent without a parcel action will invent an answer. The report therefore specifies an Apex action that returns structured data, agent instructions that forbid guessing, and the remaining validation steps \(TC-06 and TC-08\). Completing them is the final step before the prototype can be described as fully validated.)
/E (Testing also produced useful engineering findings. Merge-field grounding reproduces stored values exactly, but an agent without a parcel action will invent an answer. The report therefore specifies an Apex action that returns structured data, agent instructions that forbid guessing, and the remaining validation steps \(TC-06 and TC-08\). Completing them is the final step before the prototype can be described as fully validated.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [1]
>>
