/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 220 0 R
/T (The SwiftShip Tracker project successfully demonstrates the design, configuration, and validation of an AI-enabled parcel management architecture on the Salesforce platform. By unifying custom relational schemas, automated flows, grounded AI prompt templates, and Agentforce conversational capabilities, the prototype eliminates parcel tracking fragmentation and streamlines logistics operations. This implementation provides a scalable, enterprise-grade foundation for modern parcel management, customer support automation, and logistics analytics.)
/E (The SwiftShip Tracker project successfully demonstrates the design, configuration, and validation of an AI-enabled parcel management architecture on the Salesforce platform. By unifying custom relational schemas, automated flows, grounded AI prompt templates, and Agentforce conversational capabilities, the prototype eliminates parcel tracking fragmentation and streamlines logistics operations. This implementation provides a scalable, enterprise-grade foundation for modern parcel management, customer support automation, and logistics analytics.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
