<<
/Title (Rigorous requirement definition is fundamental to platform architecture. Formalising functional specifications and quality attributes prevents architectural drift, aligns engineering tasks with operational goals, and ensures that automated workflows directly support business processes. The functional capabilities were synthesised into twelve requirement specifications \(FR-01 to FR-12\).)
