3497 0 obj
<<
/Title (The traditional operational baseline in legacy logistics environments is severely constrained by information fragmentation. When parcel tracking data is distributed across manual logbooks, isolated spreadsheets, telephone support queues, and proprietary localised software, severe operational friction ensues. Field delivery personnel lack real-time mechanisms to log status transitions, while customer support teams must execute manual lookups across disconnected databases merely to address basic status inquiries. This results in high administrative costs, elevated data-entry error rates, delayed issue resolution, and degraded customer trust.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2507 0 R
/Prev 3298 0 R
/First 3608 0 R
/Last 3608 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 3299 0 R
>>
endobj
3498 0 obj
<<
/Title (Centralise parcel, delivery, sender, and receiver records within a relational CRM data schema. Streamline end-to-end parcel lifecycle tracking from booking to final delivery confirmation.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3299 0 R
/Next 3609 0 R
>>
