/Title (The SwiftShip Tracker is structured as a multi-tiered enterprise framework. Decoupling presentation, application logic, data storage, process orchestration, generative AI processing, security governance, and analytics ensures that individual tiers, such as prompt templates or background flows, can be optimised or expanded without destabilising the core schema or its data access security. The eight structural layers are shown below.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3304 0 R
/Next 3507 0 R
>>
endobj
3507 0 obj
<<
/Title (Data flows downward through this hierarchy during transaction ingestion and upward during query execution. For example, a conversational query submitted at the Interface Tier passes to the AI Integration Layer, triggers the Automation Tier to query the Data Layer under strict Security & Governance enforcement, and returns a grounded response to the user.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3304 0 R
/Prev 3506 0 R
>>
