/Title (The SwiftShip Tracker project successfully demonstrates the design, configuration, and validation of an AI-enabled parcel management architecture on the Salesforce platform. By unifying custom relational schemas, automated flows, grounded AI prompt templates, and Agentforce conversational capabilities, the prototype eliminates parcel tracking fragmentation and streamlines logistics operations. This implementation provides a scalable, enterprise-grade foundation for modern parcel management, customer support automation, and logistics analytics.)
/Dest [42 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3703 0 R
/Next 3711 0 R
>>
endobj
3711 0 obj
<<
/Title (Testing also produced useful engineering findings. Merge-field grounding reproduces stored values exactly, but an agent without a parcel action will invent an answer. The report therefore specifies an Apex action that returns structured data, agent instructions that forbid guessing, and the remaining validation steps \(TC-06 and TC-08\). Completing them is the final step before the prototype can be described as fully validated.)
/Dest [42 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3703 0 R
/Prev 3710 0 R
>>
